V-70115 SV-84737r1_rule Windows 10 Mobile must generate audit records. <VulnDiscussion>Audit logs enable monitoring of security-relevant events and subsequent forensics when breaches occur. They help identify attacks, so that breaches can either be prevented or limited in their scope. They facilitate analysis to improve performance and security. Auditable events include:

1. Start-up and shutdown of the audit functions;
2. All administrative actions;
3. Start-up and shutdown of the OS and kernel;
4. Insertion or removal of removable media;
5. Establishment of a synchronizing connection;
6. Specifically defined auditable events in Table 10 of MDF PP v.2.0.

